      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This poster focuses on two digital learning objects which use hypertext, animations and video. The digital learning objects for Obesity and Dyslipidemia are being evaluated through a research project implemented by the undergraduate nursing students at The Federal University do Rio Grande do Sul (UFRGS). The project \"Digital Learning Objects: Obesity and Dyslipidemia\" is designed to subsidize the questions about non-communicable chronic diseases in the academic and professional routine in primary health care."},
